f. NetApp Interview Question

fa. Why not use RAID 1 everywhere?

Answer:

Excellent protection
But wastes 50% storage

If I buy 100 TB

I only get 50 TB usable.

Very expensive.

fb. Why is RAID 5 less popular with SSDs?

Because parity calculations add overhead and SSD rebuilds create write amplification.

fc. NetApp Angle

NetApp uses RAID-DP (Double Parity) which is similar to RAID 6 and protects against simultaneous disk failures.
